<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Mtumi Pauli ndi mweayandiki chitabu ichi pagati ya mwaka wa 48-57, peamali kuvelekewa Kilisitu na avayandikili misambi ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu pamulima wa Galatia yeyalongoswayi na Valumi. Vasomi vimanya lepi uchakaka kuvya lukumbi iyandika balua iyi avi koki nambu yihotoleka avi kumuji wa Efeso amala Kolinto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli avayandikili vandu voha vevakumsadika Kilisitu, Vayawudi na vandu vangali Vayawudi, mumisambi ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu pamulima wa Galatia ayandiki ndava ya kubesa mawuliwu ga udesi gegajovili kuvya yiganikiwa kwa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu valanda malagizu ga Vayawudi kuhuma mu Lilaganu la Kadeni, neju kudumula jandu. Kwavili na msambi wa vandu pagati ya vamsadika vevavili Vayawudi vevaganayi vamsadika vangali Vayawudi vadumuliwa jandu. Mewa vavi na makotesi gamahele gegabela uhotola wa utumi wa Pauli. Pauli aukengalili utumi waki kwa kudandaula malovi gaki mwene (musula ya 1:11-2:14). Na kuyikengelela Linenu la Bwina mukujova kuvya usangula wipatikana mu njila ya kumsadika Yesu Kilisitu ndu (musula 2:16). Mulijambu lenili ndi Chapanga ilangisa uganu waki na lepi matendu ga vandu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli itumbula balua yaki mukuvajambusa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Galatia (musula ya 1:1-5).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Pauli idandaula na mambu gaki mwene na kukengelela gala geiwula na kulangisa chealingili kutama kwa kulanda malagizu nambu yahotoliki lepi (musula ya 1:6-2:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili idandaula neju ndava ya lihengu la malagizu na ubwina wa Chapanga muusangula (musula ya 3-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Neju ya ago akuvapela malagizu ndava ya kutama bwina mukumsadika Kilisitu (musula ya 5:6-10).</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli imakisila balua yaki kwa jambu na kuvayupa vakumbuka kuvya, kung'anamuswa na Chapanga na kuvya mundu wa mupya ndi chabwina neju kuliku malagizu gegihengeka muhiga ngati kudumula jandu (musula ya 6:11-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Nene namtumi Pauli mwenikemiwi kuvya mtumi lepi kwa kuhaguliwa na vandu mewa lepi kwa makakala ga mundu, nambu kwa uhotola wa Yesu Kilisitu na Chapanga mweamyukisi Yesu, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />na valongo voha mwemuvi pamonga na nene, tikuvajambusa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Galatia.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Tikuvaganila uteke na ubwina kuhuma kwa Chapanga Dadi witu na Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kilisitu ajiwusili mwene avya luteta ndava ya kumbudila kwitu Chapanga ndava ya maganu ga Chapanga Dadi witu muni atisangulayi kuhuma pamulima uwu uhakau wa hinu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Chapanga alumbiwa magono na magono goha gangali mwishu! Ena.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawaka Linenu la Bwina Lingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Nikangasa neju kulola kuvya kanyata mukumleka wuli Chapanga, mweavakemili nyenye kwa ubwina wa Yesu Kilisitu, na mukulilanda linenu la Bwina ya namuna yingi. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Chakaka kawaka Linenu la Bwina la Chapanga lingi, nambu vavi vandu vevakuvayagisa, vevigana kung'anamusa Linenu la Bwina la Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Nambu hati ngati mmonga winu amala mtumu kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, akavakokosela Linenu la Bwina chingi na lila letivakokosili tete, hinu mwenuyo apewayi likoto na Chapanga. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Tamali kuvajovela mambu aga kadeni, na nene nikugawuyila kavili, mundu akavakokosela Linenu la Bwina lelivii chingi na lila lemwapokili, ndi apewa likoto na Chapanga!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Hinu kujova ago kulangisa kuvya nilonda vandu vaniyidakila? Lepi! Nigana kuyidakiliwa na Chapanga. Amala nilonda kuvaganisa vandu? Kuvya ngati nilonda kuvaganisa vandu, nganivii lepi muhengaji wa Kilisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga akumkemela Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Valongo vangu, nikuvagana mumanya kuvya Linenu la Bwina lenivakokosili lepi ujumbi kuhuma kwa mundu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ndava muni nene nakuyipokela kuhuma kwa mundu amala kuwuliwa na mundu, nambu kwa kugubukuliwa na Yesu Kilisitu mwene.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Muni muyuwini malovi ga mambu gangu chanatamili kadeni, mu njila ya Vayawudi ya kumuyupa Chapanga, kuvya nawung'aisi neju msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu na kuvakomakesa. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Namwene navahotwili vayangu va ntanga yangu mu njila ya Vayawudi ya kumuyupa Chapanga najikangamilisi neju kukamula mivelu ya vagogo vangu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Nambu Chapanga, kwa ubwina waki ndi amali kunihagula kwakona nangavelekewa, anikemili nimhengelayi, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Peanigubukulili Mwana waki muni nikokosa Linenu la Bwina ndava ya Yesu Kilisitu kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi, changali kuyupa maholo ga vandu, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />amala changahamba hoti ku Yelusalemu kwa vala vevalongolili kuvya vamitumi, ndi nahambili hoti ku Alabia, kangi nikawuya ku Damasko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Hinu, payamaliki miyaka yidatu, ndi penakahambili ku Yelusalemu kukonganeka na Kefa mweikemiwa mewa Petili, natamili kwaki mu magono kumi na mhanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Nambu namuweni lepi mtumi yungi nga Yakobo mwene, mlongo waki Bambu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Genikuvayandikila ndi ga chakaka, Chapanga agamanyili, nikuvajovela lepi ga udesi.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Mwanakandahi nihambili ku mulima wa Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Lukumbi lwenulo, namwene navi nangawonekana na msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Yudea. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Chevachimanyili ndi chila ndu chevayuwini, “Mundu yula mweating'aili hoti, hinu akuyikokosa sadika yilayila yeagana kuyiyongomesa!” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Hinu, vakamulumba Chapanga ndava ya nene.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pauli iyidakiliwa na vamitumi vangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Payamaliki miyaka kumi na mcheche, nikahamba kavili ku Yelusalemu, pamonga na Banaba na Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nahambili ndava ya ugubukulo weanipeli Chapanga. Hinu panakonganiki nawu vene vachilongosi ndu pachiepela ndi navadandaulili ujumbi wa Linenu la Bwina lenakokosai kwa vandu vangali Vayawudii. Nahengili genago muni lihengu lenimali kuhenga, na lenihenga hinu likoto kuvya waka. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Hati muyangu Tito mwenalongosini nayu, pamonga ndi Mgiliki, nambu nakuganikiwa kudumula jandu. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Pamonga kwavili na vavajikitili vamsadika vayitu vevaganili adumuliwa jandu. Vandu venavo vajiyingisi kwa kuchenjela na umang'omesi kulekekeswa kwitu kwetivi naku mukujiwunga na Kilisitu Yesu, muni vatikita vavanda. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Nambu nakuyidakilana nawu hati padebe, muni uchakaka wa Linenu la Bwina usigalila na nyenye magono goha.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Vandu venavo vevijovekana kuvya vachilongosi, ngati chakaka vachilongosi amala lepi, chindu lepi kwa nene muni Chapanga ihamula lepi ndava ya kulola mambu ga kuvala, vandu avo vana maholo lepi gakuniyonjokisa. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Pahali paki ndi vamanyili kuvya Chapanga anigotolili lihengu la kukokosa Linenu la Bwina kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi ngati Petili cheatumwili kukokosa kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Ndava muni Chapanga mweamhotwisi Petili kuvya mtumi kwa Vayawudi, ndi yuyoyo mweanihotwisi nene kuvya mtumi kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Hinu, Yakobo Kefa na Yohani vevawonikini kuvya vachilongosi vakulu, vamanyili kuvya Chapanga anipeli lihengu lenili la bwina, ndi vatikamwili mawoko tete, nene pamonga na Banaba kulangisa kuvya tavamonga. Nambu tete yatiganili tikahenga lihengu pagati ya vandu vangali Vayawudi navene pagati ya Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Nambu vatiyupili chindu chimonga tivakumbuka vangangu vevavi mu msambi wa vandu vamsadika, ndi lijambu lenikangamala kulihenga.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akumhakalila Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Nambu Petili peabwelili ku Antiokia nambelalili hotohoto palongo ya vandu muni abudili neju. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Kwakona kubwela pagati ya vandu vangi vevatumwili na Yakobo, Petili avi mukulya pamonga na vandu vangali Vayawudi. Nambu pevamali kuhika vandu vala, ndi ajibagwili na alekili kulya pamonga na vandu vangali Vayawudi, ndava ya kuyogopa chikundi cha vandu vevilasimisha vandu vangali Vayawudi kudumuliwa jandu. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Hati valongo vangi Vayawudi vamyidakili Petili muchitendu chila cha uhomela, ndi Banaba namwene akahutwa na uhomela wavi. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Hinu panawene mambu gevihenga gilandana lepi na uchakaka wa Linenu la Bwina, nikamjovela Kefa palongolo ya vandu voha, “Pamonga veve wamuyawudi, utama ngati vandu vangali Vayawudi ndi lepi ngati Myawudi! Hinu uhotola wuli kulinga kuvajovela kwa makakala vandu vangali Vayawudi kutama kuvya ngati Vayawudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi na vandu vangali Vayawudi visanguliwa kwa kusadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Chakaka, tete Tavayawudi cha kuvelekewa, lepi tavandu vangali Vayawudi “Vevikemelewa vevakumbudila Chapanga!” <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Nambu timanyili kwa chakaka mundu nakuvalangiwa mweakumganisa Chapanga mukuyidakila malagizu, nambu ndu kwa kumsadika Yesu Kilisitu. Na tete mewa timsadika Yesu Kilisitu muni tivalangiwa vetimganisa Chapanga kwa mu njila ya kumsadika Yesu Kilisitu, lepi ndava ya kuyidakila malagizu. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Nambu, kuvya tavete, mukulonda kuvalangiwa kumganisa Chapanga kwa kuwungana na Kilisitu, tawonekini kuvya vetikumbudila Chapanga, wu, Kilisitu ndi mweakuvakita vandu vambudila Chapanga? Lepi! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Nambu yikavya nijenga kavili malagizu genabomwili, hinu nene nilangisa kuvya nambudaji. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Malagizu gahengili nimanyayi kuvya niganikiwi kufwa ndi nafwili muni nihuma muuhotola wa malagizu, muni nitama ndava ya Chapanga na nene nikomiwi pamonga na Kilisitu pamsalaba. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Nambu lepi nene mwenitama nambu Kilisitu, itama mugati yangu, lepi namwene kavili, nambu Kilisitu ndi avi muhiga yangu, na wumi wenivii nawu nitama kwa sadika, sadika mu Mwana wa Chapanga, mweaniganili hati kuwusa wumi waki ndava yangu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Nakugana kubela ubwina wa Chapanga. Ngati Mundu iyidakiliwa mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga kwa kuyidakiliwa na malagizu, hinu Kilisitu afwili waka.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Malagizu amala Sadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Nyenye Vagalatia vayimu! Ndi yani mweavahavili? Malovi ga kuvambiwa Yesu Kilisitu gajoviwi hotohoto palongolo yinu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Nigana kumanya chindu chimonga kuhuma kwa nyenye, wu, mwapokili Mpungu wa Chapanga ndava ya kuyidakila malagizu amala ndava ya kuyuwana kusadika Linenu la Bwina? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Uyimu winu uvi wuli? Nyenye mwatumbwili goha kwa utangatila wa Mpungu wa Chapanga, wuli hinu mwigana kumalakisa kwa makakala ginu mwavene? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Wu, mambu goha gegavakolili nyenye gawaka? Nakuhotoleka! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Wu, Chapanga avapelili Mpungu waki na kukita chinamtiti pagati yinu ndava mwilanda malagizu, amala ndava mwiyuwana Linenu la Bwina na kusadika?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Mlola luhumu lwa Ibulahimu ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova, mwene amsadiki Chapanga, ndi mwene awonikini mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Hinu mumanya kuvya vala vevakumsadika Chapanga ndi chakaka vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova kuhuma kadeni kuvya Chapanga yati akuvavalangila vandu vangali Vayawudi kuvya vabwina palongolo yaki mu njila ya sadika. Ndava Chapanga amkokosili hoti Linenu la Bwina Ibulahimu, “Vandu va milima yoha yati vimotisiwa ndava ya veve.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Hinu, vala vevisadika yati vimotisiwa pamonga na Ibulahimu mweisadika.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ndava muni vandu voha vevihuvalila kuyidakila gegiganikiwa na malagizu, vavi mulikoto muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Yoyoha mwangakamula goha gegayandikwi muchitabu cha malagizu ndi avili mulikoto.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Ndi hotohoto kuvya kawaka mundu mweivalangiwa kulolekana mbwina palongolo kwa malagizu, ndava muni mweilolekana mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga yati itama kwa sadika. <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Nambu malagizu yihumila lepi kusadika, nambu Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Mweiyidakila gegiganikiwa mu Malagizu yati itama.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kilisitu atigombwili tete kuhuma mulikoto la malagizu, mukujitolela likoto ndava yitu, muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Mundu yeyoha mweavambiwi pamkongo ana likoto.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Lijambu lenili lahengiki muni mota yeapewili Ibulahimu yivahikila vandu vangali Vayawudi mu njila ya Kilisitu Yesu, muni musadika timpokela Mpungu Msopi mweatilagazili Chapanga.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu na lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Valongo vangu, yati nikuvapela luhumu lwa wumi witu wa magono goha, vandu vavili vakakita lilaganu kwa kulapa, kawaka mundu kudenya amala kuyonjokesa chindu mu lilaganu lenilo. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Hinu, Ibulahimu alagaziwi na Chapanga, mwene pamonga na “Vachiveleku vaki mayandiku gijova lepi, na chiveleku chaki,” Yani ndi mmonga ndi Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Chenichi ndi chenijova, Chapanga avikili lilaganu laki na Ibulahimu. Payapitili malagizu miyaka miya mcheche na selasini ndi malagizu peyaletiwi. Malagizu genago nakuhotola kulidenya amala kuhungula lilagizu la Chapanga. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ngati njombi yeniyi ya Chapanga ngayihuvalili uyidakila wa Malagizu, hinu njombi yeniyo ngayihuvalili lepi lilaganu la Chapanga. Nambu Chapanga kwa ubwina waki ampelili Ibulahimu njombi yeniyi ndava ya lilaganu leampeli Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Hinu malagizu gana lihengu loki? Yayonjokiswi muni kulangisa kubuda, mbaka peibwela chiveleku cha Ibulahimu yula mweapewili lilaganu lila. Malagizu gegaletiwi na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga muchiwoko cha mtepulanisi Musa. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Nambu mtepulanisi iganikiwa lepi ngati lijambu lene likumvala mundu mmonga, na Chapanga ndi mmonga.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndava ya malagizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Wu, malagizu gibelana na lilaganu la Chapanga? Lepi hati padebe! Muni kuvya uhumili mu malagizu gegakuvapela vandu wumi, ndi ngatiwonikini vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga kwa kuyidakila malagizu. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Nambu lepi, Mayandiku Gamsopi gamali kujova kuvya mulima woha uvi uvanda wa kumbudila Chapanga. Muni vevisadika vapewayi njombi yila yeavalagazili Chapanga, mukumsadika Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Nambu kwakona kubwela sadika yila, nambu takungiwi na mhilu ngati vafungwa mbaka payabweli sadika yigubukuliwayi. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Hinu malagizu gavi na makakala panani yitu mbaka pahaikili Kilisitu, muni tilolekana vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Nambu ndava sadika yimali kubwela, tete nakuvya kavili pahi ya uhotola panani yitu.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Mu njila ya sadika nyenye mwavoha ndi vana va Chapanga mukuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Muni mwavoha nyenye mwemubatiziwi na kujiwunga na Kilisitu, mutama ngati Kilisitu cheigana mutama. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kawaka kavili mbagulanu pagati ya Vayawudi amala Vandu vangali Vayawudi, vavanda amala vandu mwemlekekiwi, kawaka mgosi amala mdala, muni mwavoha ndi mwavamonga mukuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ngati nyenye ndi vandu va Kilisitu ndi chiveleku cha Ibulahimu ndi yati mwipewa lilaganu lila leajovili Chapanga.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Hinu, nijova kuvya, mhali, akavya akona mwana, iwanangana na mvanda pamonga ndi mhali wa vindu vyoha. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Lukumbi lwenulo lwoha, ivya mu mawoko ga vevakumulela na vandu vevakumuyunga, mbaka lukumbi lweluvikiwi na dadi waki lutimila. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Mewawa tete patavili takona kukangala musadika, tavi vavanda va mzuka vachilongosi va mulima. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Nambu lukumbi lwabwina palwatimili, Chapanga amtumili mwana waki mweavelekiwi na mdala, akatama muulongosi wa malagizu ga Vayawudi, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />ndava avagombola vala vevavi pahi ya malagizu muni tete tikitiwa vana va Chapanga.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Ndava muni nyenye hinu ndi vana vaki, Chapanga amtumili Mpungu wa Mwana waki mumitima yinu, Mpungu wewivemba “Aba” Ndi “Dadi.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Hinu veve wamvanda lepi kavili, nambu wamwana, Chapanga alavapela nyenye gala goha geavalagazili kuvapela.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuvaholalela Vagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kadeni pemwammanyili lepi Chapanga, ndi mwaihengili michapanga ya waka, lepi Chapanga wa chakaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Nambu hinu, ndava mumanya Chapanga, amala tijova mwimanyikana na Chapanga, mwihotola wuli kuwuya kavili kwa vala mizuka yingangu na yangali makakala? Hati kugana kuvahengela kavili? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mwakona mwilanda magono gakulu, ga miyehi na lusenje na miyaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Niyogopa pangi lihengu lanahengili ndava yinu liyagili waka!<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Valongo vangu, nikuvayupa neju mvya ngati nene, muni hati nene nivii ngati nyenye. Nakunihengela uhakau wowoha. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Nambu mwimanya kuvya utamu wangu ndi wanipeli fwasi ya kukokosa Linenu la Bwina mala ya kutumbula lukumbi. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Pamonga utamu wangu wavili mang'ahiso kwinu, nambu likumbi lula mwenivevisi lepi amala kunibela ndava ya utamu wangu pamonga vavakofii kukita ago. Nambu mwanipokili ngati mtumu wa kunani wa Chapanga, ngati kuvya Kilisitu Yesu mwene. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Mwavi na luheku, hinu chihumili kyani? Chakaka nikuvajovela kuvya lukumbi lula ngamuhotwili hati kutupula mihu ginu na kunipela nene. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Hinu wu, ndi na likoko winu ndava ya kuvajovela uchakaka?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Vandu vangi avo vevakuvang'aikila nyenye, maholo gavi, lepi gabwina. Vigana kuvabagulana na nene muni nyenye muvang'aikila vene. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Chakaka ndi lijambu la bwina kuvang'aikila vangi mu mambu gabwina, lepi ndu lukumbi penivya na nyenye. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Vana vangu, mewawa ngati mau mweavi na ndumbu cheivya na lipyanda la kuveleka, ndi nene mewawa chening'aika mewa ndava yinu mbaka pemwitumbula kutama ngati chatamili Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ngati kuvya nivya pamonga na nyenye hinu, muni nganimanyili ukangamisu weuganikiwa ndava yinu! Nivii na wogohi neju na nyenye!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu kuhuma kwa Hagali na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Mnijovela mwavene mwemgana kulongoswa na malagizu, wu, mwiyuwana malagizu chegijova? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Yiyandikiwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi kuvya Ibulahimu avili na vana vavili, mmonga kwa mdala mvanda na yungi mumdala mwealekekswi. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Mwana wa mdala mvanda yula avelikwi ndu, nambu yula wa mdala mwealekekiswi avelikwi ngati chevivelekewa vandu vangi. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Mambu genaga ndi luhumu, vamau venavo vavili ndi luhumu lwa malaganu gavili, la kutumbula lila la kuchitumbi cha Sinai, likumvala Hagali, na vana vaki vevivelekewa muuvanda. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hagali iyima pahali pachitumbi cha Sinai weuvi Alabia, ndi luhumu lwa Yelusalemu ya hinu, yeyivii muuvanda na vana vaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Nambu Yelusalemu ya kunani kwa Chapanga ndi muji weulekekiswi, wene ndi nyina witu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Muni yiyandikwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Uheka, vangaveleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">luluta kwa lwami luheku, vangaveleka mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">muni vana va yula mwealekiwi ndi vamahele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kuliku va yula mweagegiwi.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Hinu, valongo vangu, nyenye ndi vana va Chapanga ndava lilaganu laki ngati cheavili Izaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Nambu ngati magono gala mwana mweavelekiwi ngati chevivelekewa vandu vangi amung'aili yula mweavelekiwi kwa makakala ga Mpungu wa Chapanga, mewawa na magono aga. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Nambu Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova wuli? Gijova “Mvinga mau mvanda pamonga na mwana waki, muni mwana wa mvanda ihala lepi pamonga na mwana wa mau mwealekekiswi.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Hinu valongo, tete lepi vana va mvanda nambu va mau mwealekekiswi.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Kilisitu atilekekesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kilisitu atilekekisi muuvanda, aganili tisigalila valekekeswa. Hinu ndi mkangamala kuyima ndi mkoto kuyidakila kavili kuvya pahi ya lingolingoli la uvanda.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Myuwanila! Ndi nene Pauli mwenijova na nyenye! Ngati muyidakili kudumuliwa jandu, Kilisitu yati iwonekana chindu lepi kwinu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nijova kavili hotohoto, mundu yoyoha mweiyidakila kudumula jandu yikumgana kuyidakila Malagizu goha ga Musa. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ngati mwilinga kuhengewa gabwina mu njila ya malagizu, ndi mujibagwili kutali na Kilisitu, muvi kutali na ubwina wa Chapanga. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Nambu tete kwa upandi witu, tilindila kwa huvalila ya makakala ga Mpungu Msopi tukitiwa vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga mu njila ya sadika. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ndava muni tiwungini na Kilisitu Yesu, kudumuliwa jandu amala changadumuliwa chindu lepi, chechiganikiwa sadika yeyilangiswa kwa kuganana.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Lugendu lwinu lwa bwina! Yani, hinu mweavabesili kuuyidakila uchakaka? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Mweahengili chindu chenicho lepi Chapanga mweavakemili. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />“Mawuliwu aga ga udesi ngati ngemeku yidebe lelitutumusa lilundu loha la uhembe,” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ndava ya kuwungana kwitu nihuvalila pavaha kuvya nyenye nakuvya na usindimala wa namuna yingi. Ndi mundu yeyoha mweakuvang'aha yati iamuliwa na Chapanga.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Nambu muupandi wangu, valongo vangu, ngati kwakona nikokosa kuwuya yikuvagana kudumuliwa jandu, ndava kyani hinu nakona ninyagiwa? Kuvya ago, makokosa gangu ndava ya msalaba wa Kilisitu yagileta mtahu. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Nilola chabwina vala vevakuvang'aha kudumuliwa jandu kwa makakala mbanga ngavajitenili vene!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Valongo vangu nyenye, mwakemeliwi mlekekeswa. Nambu kulekekeswa kwenuko kukoto kuvya chidetelu cha kulanda mnogo uhakau wemuvelikwi nawu, nambu yikuvagana kutumikila kwa uganu. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Muni malagizu goha gitimiliswa mukuyidakila amuli yeniyi yimonga, “Mgana muyaku ngati cheukujigana wamwene.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Nambu ngati mdakulana na kulumana ngati hinyama ya kudahi mjiyangalila mkoto kuyongomesana vene kwa vene!<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumi wewilongoswa na Mpungu wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Hinu nijova naha: Mpungu Msopi alongosa wumi winu, ndi mwavene nakulonda kavili mnogo wa pamulima. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Muni mnogo uhakau wipingana na maganu ga Mpungu Msopi, na maganu ga Mpungu Msopi wa Chapanga. Mambu gavili genago giwanangana lepi, ndava ya yeniyo nakuhotola kuhenga gala gemkugagana mwavene. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Nambu mwakalongoswa na Mpungu nakuvya kavili pahi ya ulongosi wa malagizu.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Hinu, matendu gegihuma na mnogo uhakau wa higa, ndi kukita ugoni na mambu gahakau kugana vindu vyamahele, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kugundamila chimong'omong'o na uhavi na umakoko na luhonda na wihu ligoga na unotani, mhutanu na mpechenganu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />lingele na kugala uhutulu na mambu gangi gegiwanangana na ago. Nikuvajovela kavili genamali kujova, vandu vevihenga mambu ago vihala lepi Unkosi wa Chapanga.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Nambu mundu mweilongoswa na Mpungu wa Chapanga ivya na uganu na luheku na uteke na usindimala na ubwina na mtima wabwina na usadikika, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ungolongondi na kujilongosa vene. Kawaka malagizu gegihotola kubesa mambu ago. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ndi vala vevavi na Kilisitu Yesu vavambiwi pamonga na Kilisitu na kuleka mambu gahakau gavahengayi. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Mukutama kwa kulongoswa na Mpungu Msopi, ndi tihengayi gala geigana. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Hinu timekela na luhonda amala kulolelana wihu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Mtangatanayi ndwika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Valongo vangu, ngati mkumlola mundu nunuyu abudili, hinu nyenye mwemulongoswa na Mpungu mumwuyisa kavili mundu mwenuyo, nambu muhenga kwa ungolongondi, mujiyangalila mwavene mkoto kuyingila mukulingiwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Mtangatilana kugegesana ndwika zinu na mukukita genago yati mwitimilisa malagizu ga Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Mundu akajiwona kuvya chindu kumbi chindu lepi, mwenuyo akujikonga mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Nambu kila mundu alola bwina matendu gaki. Yikavya gabwina hinu ihotola kugahekela gala geahengili changawanangisa na mundu yungi. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Muni kila mundu iganikiwa kugega ndwika yaki mwene.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mweiwuliwa linenu la Chapanga na ampela muwula waki muvindu vyabwina vyeavili navyu.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mkoto kukongewa, Chapanga iveveswa lepi. Cheamijili mundu ndi cheibena. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ndava muni mundu yeyoha mweimija mu mnogo uhakau weavelikwi nawu yati ibena mwenumo uhakau, nambu akamija kwa kulongoswa na Mpungu yati ibena wumi wa magono goha wangali mwishu kuhuma kwa Mpungu Msopi. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Hinu tikotoka kutotokela kuhenga gabwina, muni yetibena mulukumbi lwaki, ngati tideniki lepi mtima. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ndi muni, takayvayi takona na lukumbi, tivahengela vandu voha gabwina na neju kwa vala vevakumsadika Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu gakumalikisila na jambusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Mwavene mlola chenikuvayandikila mayandiku gavaha na chiwoko changu namwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Vala vevigana kuloleka bwina kwa mambu ga higa ndi vevigana kuvajovela kwa makakala mdumula jandu. Vikita chenicho ndava yimonga, muni vigana lepi kung'ahika ndava ya kuwula ndava ya msalaba wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Muni vevadumwili jandu vene vilanda lepi malagizu, ndi vakuvagana nyenye mudumuliwa jandu muni vapata kumeka ndava ya kudumuliwa jandu kwinu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Nambu nene katu yati nimeka lepi chochoha nambu ndi msalaba wa Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu, muni ndava ya msalaba wenuwo mulima woha uvambiwi kwa nene, ndava mambu ga pamulima gakuniganisa lepi nivii ngati mwenifwili kwa mambu ago. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kudumuliwa amala kubela kudumuliwa jandu chindu lepi, jambu livaha ndi mundu kuvya wamupya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Vevilanda ulongosi uwu nikuvayupila uteke na lipyana, uteke na lipyana uvya kwa vandu va Isilaeli na vandu voha va Chapanga.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Kutumbula hinu, mundu yoyoha akotoka kuning'aha kavili, muni ulangisu wenivi nawu muhiga yangu yilangisa kuvya nene ndi wa Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Valongo vangu ubwina wa Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu uvya na pamonga nyenye. Ena.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>